{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"她突然安静下来，像是不再需要他陪了，但想靠近他的那股劲其实还没有松开。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"安静、克制、紧绷、迟疑\",\n      \"missed\": \"右上角高亮的当前心理状态“忽然怕他不再需要自己”比较小，容易漏掉。后两句关于明朗变暗、冲势收住、像对视到呼吸停止的描述，需要逐句读才能抓到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"她好像突然收住了靠近他的冲动，表面安静下来，但内心并没有真正放下。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"安静、压抑、犹豫、紧张\",\n      \"missed\": \"右侧最后一条才明确点出她害怕他不再需要自己。前面几条关系变化的来龙去脉，以及声音逐渐下沉变暗的具体画面，需要细读。下方音符动画此时比较密集，但不能直接补充人物处境。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"她突然安静了，原本想靠近他的势头停下来，但那份想靠近的心情还在。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"安静、克制、失落、悬而未决\",\n      \"missed\": \"最重要的隐藏情绪仍是“忽然怕他不再需要自己”，需要注意右上角的小字才能确认。关于颤音、轻柔和弦和对视屏息的画面，也不是一眼就能完整抓到的。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"最影响扫读的是左侧最大标题“不再需要他陪”和右侧高亮的“忽然怕他不再需要自己”之间的关系没有一眼建立起来：前者非常醒目，后者小得多，容易只看到表面上的不再需要，却漏掉内心其实害怕失去被需要的感觉。第一句正文能够把想靠近、没有真正松开的状态接上，但后面两句较长的声音与画面描述，需要读完才能和人物情绪连起来。整体有清楚的视觉主次，人物的安静和克制也能抓到，主要缺口是核心担忧不够醒目。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "bded1f1c-44b6-47e4-bade-7ec0e4f2a85a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T005405189680Z", "elapsed_seconds": 97.344, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:55:42.529497+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a3fe13ef4ea47bb32e6f0b34824d87522f600c7a06deef2ab93071d1a85907ee", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T005405189680Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "e47c968055f45d3be52f15433afb1c9be9ce2c8cea62f0ca5024cd1dcb8c634b"}}}
